          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger </strong>The Stonewyrm enters its Maw Frenzy</p><p><strong>Effect </strong>The Den Mother recovers from the initial drill through the Stonewyrm's protective maw adamantine carapace, ready to activate again. </p><p>Add the Den Mother to the bottom of the initiative order. </p><p>Add the @UUID[Compendium.covalon.whitespire-items.Item.B1qFNjfOX1dACQpL]{Power the Den Mother} action to your PCs sheets.</p>"
