        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Den Mother moves forward 60 feet if a PC critically succeeded at Power the Den Mother, or 30 feet if a PC succeeded. This ignores difficult terrain.</p><p>If it impacts a wall, it deals @Damage[35[piercing]] damage to that wall. If this is enough to destroy the wall, its movement is not interrupted.</p><p>For each subsequent wall the drill impacts, it deals 10 less damage. @Damage[25[piercing]], @Damage[15[piercing]]</p><p>If the drill impacts a wall and the damage it deals to that wall is not enough to destroy the wall, its movement stops.</p><p>If the drill would impact a PC, that PC is harmlessly pushed out of the way and the drill continues its movement.</p><p>If the Den Mother impacts with the Stonewyrm, the Stonewyrm is immediately slain, bypassing its Maw Frenzy via Heart of Terra infused power.</p>"
        },
